        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the future, we will develop chain-joined “Gastrointestinal Health Living Museums” in Asia to provide gastrointestinal maintenance services for more customers.",
        "start_character": 15167,
        "end_character": 15328
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001575872-26-000048",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001575872-26-000048-088de00a4bd66939",
        "accession_number": "0001575872-26-000048",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The company is a holding company located in Canada that has transformed into a provider of large health and elderly care, anti-aging and high-end medical aesthetics health services, and artificial intelligence education services as its main business.",
        "start_character": 22070,
        "end_character": 22320
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001575872-26-000048",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001575872-26-000048-088de00a4bd66939",
        "accession_number": "0001575872-26-000048",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-28",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The company offers college programs through Conbridge College of Business and Technology (Conbridge).",
        "start_character": 30273,
        "end_character": 30374
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001575872-26-000048",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001575872-26-000048-088de00a4bd66939",
        "accession_number": "0001575872-26-000048",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-28",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The company operates three schools offering OSSD programs through its subsidiaries: Visionary Academy, Toronto Art School, and Toronto ESchool, providing OSSD programs for Canadian local students and international students through online, in-person, and blended learning models (combining pre-recorded courses, live courses, tutoring courses, and online and offline consulting).",
        "start_character": 29620,
        "end_character": 29998
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001575872-26-000048",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001575872-26-000048-088de00a4bd66939",
        "accession_number": "0001575872-26-000048",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-28",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The company provides education projects at the middle school, university, and higher degree levels, as well as supporting services such as housing and career guidance.",
        "start_character": 24914,
        "end_character": 25081
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001575872-26-000048",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001575872-26-000048-088de00a4bd66939",
        "accession_number": "0001575872-26-000048",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-28",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To help international students smoothly transition to life in Canada and achieve development, the company provides auxiliary education services such as study and immigration visa processing, student accommodation, employment placement, internships, and entrepreneurship support.",
        "start_character": 31449,
        "end_character": 31727
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001575872-26-000048",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001575872-26-000048-088de00a4bd66939",
        "accession_number": "0001575872-26-000048",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide customers with world-leading anti-aging and high-end medical aesthetics services.",
        "start_character": 15386,
        "end_character": 15478
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001575872-26-000048",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001575872-26-000048-088de00a4bd66939",
        "accession_number": "0001575872-26-000048",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We will integrate global resources, technologies, markets, and teams, actively form close cooperation with world-renowned relevant institutions, strengthen multi-faceted and multi-level mergers, acquisitions, and restructurings, and focus on developing anti-aging and high-end medical aesthetics services using the world's most advanced technologies and innovative methods, aiming to achieve annual revenue exceeding 100 million US dollars in the next 2 years.",
        "start_character": 37613,
        "end_character": 38073
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001575872-26-000048",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001575872-26-000048-088de00a4bd66939",
        "accession_number": "0001575872-26-000048",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "At the same time, we also developed online teaching files for more than 60 OSSD courses (core courses and a wide range of elective courses).",
        "start_character": 3027,
        "end_character": 3167
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001575872-26-000048",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001575872-26-000048-088de00a4bd66939",
        "accession_number": "0001575872-26-000048",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on the company's future development plan, we will accelerate the development of the health and wellness project.",
        "start_character": 37280,
        "end_character": 37398
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001575872-26-000048",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001575872-26-000048-088de00a4bd66939",
        "accession_number": "0001575872-26-000048",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In February 2024, we established Visionary Health Industry Investment Co., Ltd., a holding subsidiary in Guangzhou, to develop the micro-ecological health industry, focusing on the maintenance of gastrointestinal health.",
        "start_character": 8969,
        "end_character": 9189
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001575872-26-000048",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001575872-26-000048-088de00a4bd66939",
        "accession_number": "0001575872-26-000048",
